SUMMARY:Out to Lunch: West Elmira Library Calligraphy Club
DESCRIPTION:Artist Wynn Yarrow and members of the West Elmira Library Calligraphy Club will join us to share some of what they’ve been working on. They will be demonstrating and offering tips for calligraphy writing. \nBring your own lunch and drop by to hear a short talk on local history. Light refreshments provided.These programs are free and open to the public. Call 607-734-4167 for more information
URL:https://chemungvalleymuseum.org/event/out-to-lunch-west-elmira-library-calligraphy-club/
LOCATION:Chemung Valley Museum\, 415 E. Water Street\, Elmira\, NY\, 14901
