SUMMARY:Out to Lunch: Ghostly Readings 2026
DESCRIPTION:For the eighth year in a row\, staff will read and answer questions about the scripts from this year’s Ghost Walk. Not to be missed! \nBring your own lunch and drop by to hear a short talk on local history. Light refreshments provided.These programs are free and open to the public. Call 607-734-4167 for more information \n 
URL:https://chemungvalleymuseum.org/event/out-to-lunch-ghostly-readings-2026/
